  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "因涉入假球案而跌落神壇的前職棒選手林勝毅，再次回到漁村故鄉，卻聽到父親「活不久了」的消息。勝毅前去探望，卻在幽暗的醫院病房內，發現一場牽涉父親的謀殺案！勝毅雖成功阻止了謀殺，卻被警察百般刁難，與此同時，本在病房的父親也失去了蹤影。勝毅與弟弟勝彬上路尋找父親，卻在過程中發現父親的死期早已淪為「死亡賭局」的標的⋯⋯。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "以死相賭 敢不敢All-in",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Years after being caught in a game-fixing scandal, former professional baseball player Lin Shengyi returns to his hometown one night, only to discover that his father's impending death has become part of a \"death betting scheme\", operated under The Elders Mutual-Aid Association. With the help of his former lover and his younger brother, Shengyi makes a desperate decision — to save his father and flee through the night, determined to escape the town before sunrise.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Dead End"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "De retour dans sa ville natale, une star du baseball à la retraite cherche à démanteler le réseau à l’origine de paris sur le moment précis de la mort de son père, gravement malade.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Dead End"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CH",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Zurück in seiner Heimatstadt versucht ein ehemaliger Baseballstar, das Netzwerk zu zerschlagen, das Wetten auf den genauen Todeszeitpunkt seines schwerkranken Vaters organisiert.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Dead End"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "改编自轰动全台“台中死亡一条街”真实新闻事件，揭露以老人互助会为背景，利用老人性命作赌注并买凶杀人的残酷真相。曾卷⼊假球案的职业棒球选⼿林胜毅（春风 饰）多年后某夜返乡，惨变“落水狗”的他本想回家乡以收地方式大捞一笔，却意外发现全村人为“死亡赌局”陷入疯狂状态。⽗亲生死更被设为赌局，限期就在当晚！在旧情⼈品文（姚以缇 饰）和弟弟胜彬（黄奇斌 饰）两⼈的帮助下，胜毅决定带着父亲⼀夜狂奔，设法在这当晚逃出小镇。怎料逃亡时发现小镇所有人神色奇怪，身边的品文及弟弟更有不少疑点。当中存在什么阴谋？胜毅又能否在死亡限期前保着父亲的命？",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "死亡赌局"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
